      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;delight-catherine-ingram&#34;&gt;Delight Catherine Ingram&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/delight_ingram.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Catherine Ingram&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;../../images/1592400493.01.TZZZZZZZ.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;../../images/1592400493.01.TZZZZZZZ.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Purchase her book &amp;rsquo; &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1592400493/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Passionate Presence: Experiencing the Seven Qualities of Awakened Awareness&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo; from which this chapter is taken.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.catherineingram.com&#34;&gt;Catherine Ingram&amp;rsquo;s Website &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Link to entry on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/teachers/teachersh_l.htm#ingram&#34;&gt;Current Teacher&amp;rsquo;s page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A complete chapter form her book &amp;lsquo;Passionate Presence&amp;rsquo; has been donated by Catherine and it is all wonderful, so is included here in its entirety. However, should you wish only to read a relatively small sample, Catherine recommends the section entitled &amp;lsquo;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/delight_ingram.htm#moon&#34;&gt;The Moon is Always Full&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
